# Archives (St Petersburg). Bond starts unarmed in the interrogation room. assets/obseg/setup/UsetuparchZ.c (the older
# macro style: flags as written; AI list ids = setChrAIListID(N) = 0x401 + N):
#   0 (all) enter the room of pad 152 (out of the interrogation wing)
#   1 (all) flag 0x100: chrAI_8 (list 0x409, Natalya) sets it the moment she can see Bond, then she follows him
#     (chrAI_7, list 0x408: keeps 0x400 set while she lives and runs after Bond)
#   2 (SA+) collect tag 2, fails on 0x1000   3 (all) enter the room of pad 208 with 0x400 (she is with him); fails on
#     0x200 (bgAI_1: chr 0 - Natalya - gone). bgAI_0 runs the ending once Bond is in the room of pad 208.
# Round 5: she was met (133 s) and then died in Bond's line of fire (allies now count as bystanders), then fell behind:
# the exit came without 0x400 - `escort` waits for her (she trails 250-400 behind: 650, else Bond waits for ever).
name archives
obj=0 goto pad 152 60
obj=1 meet ai 0x409 200 120
escort ai 0x408 650
auto
goto pad 208 60
exit
